<title>USA: International Speedway increases dividend.</title>
<headline>International Speedway increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Speedway Corp said it increased its annual dividend to $0.06 per share on its class B shares from $0.053 per share after the effect of a 15-for-1 stock split in November 1996.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable June 30 to shareholders of record on May 30.</p>
<p>The prior dividend paid before a 15-for-1 stock split in November 1996 was $0.80 per share.</p>
